<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> <span class="c4">What is the BiS Assassination Rogue gear?</span></h3>Targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list from the ideal Assassination  Rogue drops found in Phase 5 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be almost as good, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/rogue/assassination/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Assassination Rogues</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
