<del></del></span> Legendary Cloak for Assassination Rogue</span></h2>Finally, we're able to acquire <a class="q5 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=102248/fen-yu-fury-of-xuen">
<img alt="Fen-Yu, Fury of Xuen" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_tigermelee_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fen-Yu, Fury of Xuen</span></a>. This cloak's proc is great for cleave and single target. The procs per minute will vary slightly depending on whether you're Subtlety, Combat, or Assassination, with Assassination's expected PPM (procs per minute) to be 2.70 + Haste.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
